  "description": "Foundation NUnit testing helpers for SolTechnology.Core consumers: AutoFixture data attributes (NSubstitute-based), optional Bogus customizations for realistic data, a Retry helper for eventual-consistency assertions, a shared Testcontainers lifetime/reuse model (TESTCONTAINERS_REUSE, restart-if-stopped, readiness probes) and Serilog in-memory log assertions. Reference from test projects only; not needed at runtime in production assemblies.",
